<title>USA: CET awarded $250 mln EPA contract.</title>
<headline>CET awarded $250 mln EPA contract.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>CET Environmental Services Inc said on Friday that it received a five-year environmental cleanup contract with a potential value of $250 million.</p>
<p>The contract will involve the cleanup of contaminants and hazardous materials on an emergnecy and planned basis in 15 western states, American Samoa, the Commonwealth of the Northern Marianas and Guam, CET said.</p>
<p>The stock closed at 7, up 3-1/8 points, on 53,800 shares of volume.</p>
</text>
